{"id": "141753", "name": "חישוב מכפלה פנימית שרירותית", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "prod", "params": ["u", "v"], "body": "transpose(u).ipmat.v"}, {"name": "norm", "params": ["v"], "body": "sqrt(prod(v,v))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מכפלה פנימית לא סטנדרטית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle \\)</span> על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span> המקיימת</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\langle {{CT:0}}, {{CT:0}}\\rangle={{CT:1}},\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\langle {{CT:0}}, {{CT:2}}\\rangle={{CT:3}},\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\langle {{CT:2}}, {{CT:2}}\\rangle={{CT:4}}.\\]</p><p>עבור הוקטורים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(u={{CT:5}}\\),&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(v={{CT:6}}\\),&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(w={{CT:7}}\\)</p></div><p>חשבו לפי המכפלה הפנימית הנתונה (הסתמכו על תכונות של מכפלה פנימית במרחב וקטורי):</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\"><b>תזכורת: </b>שימו לב שפתרונות מקורבים <b>לא יתקבלו</b> בשאלה זו. על מנת להזין שורש של מספר, יש לכתוב <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(X)</code> (כשבמקום X יש לכתוב את המספר).</p></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "uvprod", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> הזנת את הערך הנכון עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle u,v \\rangle\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> הערך שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle u,v \\rangle\\)</span> הינו שגוי.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "nonnegative: is(ans2 >= 0)", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "nonnegative", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. הערך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert\\)</span> אינו יכול להיות שלילי!</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "expand(ans2)", "tans": "expand(wnorm)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> הזנת את הערך הנכון עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הערך שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert\\)</span> הינו שגוי.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["eigmat", "invmat", "ipmat", "k", "n", "u", "uvprod", "v", "w", "wnorm"], "nvariants": 50}